" taskman    │  ENG-52                           /src/acme-ENG-52 eng-52-login   "
"            │                                                                   "
"▾ acme      │              The Claude session for ENG-52 has ended.             "
" ╭ Help ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮ "
" │                                                                            │ "
"┃│  Every key goes to the session, except after the ctrl+a prefix:            │ "
" │                                                                            │ "
" │  New                                                                       │ "
" │    ctrl+a n          ticket / agent: add either; an agent has no ticket    │ "
" │    ctrl+a P / A      project / account: settings, on a new one             │ "
"▸│  Go to                                                                     │ "
" │    ctrl+a [ / ]      prev/next ticket                                      │ "
" │    ctrl+a ctrl+a     next waiting: one needing you, else one done (or      │ "
" │                      tab)                                                  │ "
" │    ctrl+a w          who needs you: oldest first, with what each asks      │ "
" │    ctrl+a /          find a ticket, agent or project by typing             │ "
" │  This ticket                                                               │ "
" │    ctrl+a { / }      move: ↑/↓ go on, p moves the project, Enter ends      │ "
" │    ctrl+a e          rename agent                                          │ "
" │    ctrl+a M          run in the main checkout when the worktree failed     │ "
" │    ctrl+a x          close the ticket or agent                             │ "
" │  Open                                                                      │ "
" │    ctrl+a o / p      ticket / PR in your browser                           │ "
" │    ctrl+a l          links (ticket, PR, session) to open or copy           │ "
" │  Session                                                                   │ "
" │    ctrl+a R          restart the session                                   │ "
" │    ctrl+a t          to a terminal: continue the session in another        │ "
" │  Look back                                                                 │ "
" │    ctrl+a d          what it did: each turn's files, commits and message   │ "
" │    ctrl+a v          history in $EDITOR                                    │ "
" │    ctrl+a PgUp/PgDn  scroll back, then PgUp/PgDn ↑/↓ Home/End go on        │ "
" │  Panels                                                                    │ "
" │    ctrl+a j / c / g  tracker / comments / GitHub: show or hide each        │ "
" │    ctrl+a b          sidebar: collapse / expand it                         │ "
" │    ctrl+a r          refresh tracker and GitHub now                        │ "
" │    ctrl+a m          mark read: take the ● off this ticket's new comments  │ "
" │    ctrl+a z          fold / unfold the current project                     │ "
" │    ctrl+a Z          fold / unfold every project                           │ "
" │  General                                                                   │ "
" │    ctrl+a ,          settings: prefix, updates, sessions, theme,           │ "
" │                      notifications, projects, accounts                     │ "
" │    ctrl+a ~          notices: what the footer showed, newest first         │ "
" │    ctrl+a q          quit                                                  │ "
" │    ctrl+a a          send ctrl+a itself to the session                     │ "
" │                                                                            │ "
" │  Mouse: the wheel scrolls the pane under the pointer; click a ticket or a  │ "
" │  project header. Drag to copy text, past an edge or with the wheel for     │ "
" │  more; ctrl+c copies it again, Esc clears it. Drag a card or a project     │ "
" │  header in the sidebar to reorder it; Esc cancels.                         │ "
" │                                                                            │ "
" │    ▲ needs you  asking you something                                       │ "
" │    ⠋ working    working on something                                       │ "
" │    ● your turn  done, not looked at                                        │ "
" │    ✓ your turn  done, and seen                                             │ "
" │    ■ exited     ended, not looked at                                       │ "
" │    ■            ended, and seen                                            │ "
" │    + new        added by taskman add                                       │ "
" │    ○            idle or not started                                        │ "
" │    ☾            asleep; selecting wakes it                                 │ "
" │    ✦ lead       an agent: no ticket                                        │ "
" │    ↗ outside    in another terminal                                        │ "
" │    ↩ back       Enter resumes it here                                      │ "
" │                                                                            │ "
" │  The guide, and where to report a bug or ask for a feature: Settings       │ "
" │  (ctrl+a ,), then Help & feedback.                                         │ "
" │                                                                            │ "
" │  Press any key to close.                                                   │ "
" │                                                                            │ "
" ╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯ "
"            │                                                                   "
"                                                                                "
" ^a menu · ^a ^a next waiting · ^a ? help           ▲ 2 need you · ● 2 finished "
